683
00:25:56,409 --> 00:25:58,110
  - I've done some bad things.  

684
00:25:58,177 --> 00:26:02,515
   ♪ ♪                          

685
00:26:02,582 --> 00:26:03,783
- Me too.                       

686
00:26:03,849 --> 00:26:07,286
   ♪ ♪                          

687
00:26:07,353 --> 00:26:09,121
 [sighs]                        

688
00:26:09,188 --> 00:26:10,289
   But people change.           

689
00:26:10,356 --> 00:26:13,359
   ♪ ♪                          

690
00:26:14,794 --> 00:26:18,030
 I believe Kelly Fowler         
should be freed.                

691
00:26:21,033 --> 00:26:24,003
- And why do you                
 suddenly feel this way?        

692
00:26:24,070 --> 00:26:27,239
- [sighs] As I said, she        
   captured a fugitive for me   

693
00:26:27,306 --> 00:26:30,910
 without my even asking,        
 then returned to her own cell. 

694
00:26:30,977 --> 00:26:32,912
Seems pretty trustworthy.       

695
00:26:32,979 --> 00:26:34,614
 - Are you aware                
   of how many people           

696
00:26:34,680 --> 00:26:36,816
   Kelly Fowler has murdered?   

697
00:26:36,882 --> 00:26:38,784
 - Under direct control         
 of her mother.                 

698
00:26:38,851 --> 00:26:40,219
 May I remind you, Ves,         

699
00:26:40,286 --> 00:26:42,288
 you have one of those Maddox's 
 chips inside your head,        

700
00:26:42,355 --> 00:26:45,157
which made you do               
all sorts of things too.        

701
00:26:45,224 --> 00:26:48,060
  - Not murder.                 

702
00:26:48,127 --> 00:26:53,032
 - Didn't Miss Fowler help save 
 the colony from Maddox's chips?

703
00:26:53,099 --> 00:26:54,000
 - Yes.                         

704
00:26:54,066 --> 00:26:57,303
  - And she saved my daughter.  

705
00:26:57,370 --> 00:26:58,804
   Kelly has changed.           

706
00:26:58,871 --> 00:27:02,808
  - Our people's safety         
   is my top priority.          

707
00:27:02,875 --> 00:27:05,011
  - Ves, I believe Miss Fowler  

708
00:27:05,077 --> 00:27:08,414
   could be a big help          
   in assuring safety.          

709
00:27:08,481 --> 00:27:09,915
   She could be my assistant.   

710
00:27:09,982 --> 00:27:11,884
- And you'll take               
   full responsibility of her?  

711
00:27:11,951 --> 00:27:13,686
 - Yes, I will.                 

712
00:27:13,753 --> 00:27:15,054
  - I'll vouch for her as well. 

713
00:27:15,121 --> 00:27:18,724
  [soft dramatic music]         

714
00:27:18,791 --> 00:27:21,260
   - [scoffs]                   
   Well, then.                  

715
00:27:21,327 --> 00:27:23,462
I guess I'm outnumbered.        

716
00:27:23,529 --> 00:27:24,630
Free her.                       

717
00:27:24,697 --> 00:27:30,202
   ♪ ♪                          

718
00:27:30,269 --> 00:27:32,972
 - Yeah.                        
   Well, there it is.           

719
00:27:33,039 --> 00:27:34,473
