 than at the mess hall.         

721
00:27:43,516 --> 00:27:46,986
   Is, uh, is something wrong?  

722
00:27:47,053 --> 00:27:49,055
 - Pretty sure everyone         
 here hates me.                 

723
00:27:49,121 --> 00:27:50,556
- Kelly!                        

724
00:27:50,623 --> 00:27:52,024
  - [chuckles]                  

725
00:27:52,091 --> 00:27:53,693
  - There's at least one person 
  who doesn't hate you.         

726
00:27:53,759 --> 00:27:54,794
 - Hi, Katheryn.                

727
00:27:54,860 --> 00:27:56,762
  - Come. Eat with us.          

728
00:27:56,829 --> 00:27:57,997
  - Yeah. Go on. Go on.         

729
00:27:58,064 --> 00:27:59,265
   I'll get us all some food.   
Come on.                        

730
